From cf4a64bd1ab248294250789d48b76ee3ce94dd6b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yaegerbomb42 <yaeger.james42@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:26:04 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): resume real run across reloads (useActiveRun +
 runtime-only submit)

- new lib/client/useActiveRun: on mount GET /api/runtime/runs, pick the
  running/queued run (else most recent finished within 10 min) using a
  sessionStorage hint, restore runId + prompt for the SSE stream
- App submit no longer falls back to runAgents; 401 shows a sign-in card,
  429/503/network show the server error in a toast plus inline retry,
  simulated engine kept only behind ?demo=1
- Reset VM awaits the response and only prints complete on 2xx
- SSE stream replays the durable run log on fresh connections so a reload
  sees the full run even when the ring buffer evicted early events

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
